# <%name%> Feed

Packs and stacks for this company, read by `aidev-instruct` from the latest release of this repository.

## Packs

```json
{
  "name": "<%name%>-example",
  "description": "What the pack covers.",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "tags": ["example"],
  "requires": [],
  "conflicts": []
}
```

- `name` matches the folder and starts with `<%name%>-`.
- `version` is bumped by `npx aidev-instruct@<%version%> feed release`; never edit it by hand.
- `requires` may name official packs such as `react`.
- Rules live in `rules/<item>.md` with a `description` and `globs`, skills in `skills/<item>/SKILL.md`, agents in `agents/<item>.md`.

## Writing Style

- One H1 per file. Headings use Title Case.
- No em dashes.
- One rule per bullet, in plain present tense.
- Package, file, API and command names go in backticks.
